-- The Deeprun Tram: its entrances are the area triggers into its map 369 (AreaTrigger
-- 2173 in Stormwind, 2175 in Ironforge); rides and stops from a car's animation
-- (TransportAnimation 176080: keyframes keeping their place are a stop); 2 trains
